      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Drs. James W. Kalat and Michelle N. Shiota have written &apos;Emotion&apos; in response to a growing need for a broad-based text on the topic of Emotion. This text includes the most recent research, reflecting new thinking about the area of emotion and surveys both theoretical and practical topics, ranging from neuroscience to development and culture. It includes a strong emphasis on research methods and measurement. With unprecedented scholarship and a writing style that makes the field of emotion accessible to students, Kalat and Shiota&apos;s new text will resonate with students as both interesting and relevant.&quot; -- Publisher&apos;s website</marc:subfield>
